# ── Secrets / generated state — NEVER commit ────────────────────────────────
# Defense-in-depth: each project also ignores these, but the root repo catches
# them everywhere (e.g. a365-agent-full/backend/.env holds the blueprint secret).
**/.env
!**/.env.sample
**/a365.generated.config.json
**/*.local.json

# ── Python ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
**/*.egg-info/

# ── Publish / build artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────────────
**/manifest.zip
**/appPackage.zip
**/dist/
**/build/

# ── OS / editor ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
